---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy";
const description =
  "What this site collects, what it does not, and how advertising cookies are " +
  "used. No accounts, no logins, no personal data collected directly.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description} crumb="Reference / Privacy policy">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="lede">Last updated: 24 September 2026</p>

  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    There are no accounts and no logins. Nothing you type into a calculator or a
    filter leaves your browser. The site collects no personal information
    directly. Third-party advertising does use cookies, and that is described
    below.
  </p>

  <h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
  <div class="defs">
    <div class="def">
      <div class="h"><code>calculator_inputs</code><span class="meta">never transmitted</span></div>
      <p>Every calculator runs entirely in your browser. Amounts, dates, entry
        prices and everything else are computed locally and never sent anywhere.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="def">
      <div class="h"><code>screener_filters</code><span class="meta">never transmitted</span></div>
      <p>The screener downloads one data file and filters it on your device. Your
        threshold choices are not recorded.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="def">
      <div class="h"><code>theme_preference</code><span class="meta">localStorage</span></div>
      <p>Light or dark is stored in your browser's local storage so the page does
        not flash on reload. It never leaves your device and is not a tracker.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    This site displays advertising served by Google, which uses cookies to serve
    ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. Google's use of
    advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on
    your visits to this site and elsewhere on the internet.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can opt out of personalised advertising at
    <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener nofollow">Google Ads Settings</a>,
    or opt out of third-party vendor cookies at
    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener nofollow">aboutads.info/choices</a>.
    Blocking cookies in your browser also works; the site functions normally
    without them.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    Third-party vendors, including Google, may place and read cookies on your
    browser, or use web beacons to collect information, as a result of ad serving
    on this site.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting and logs</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    The site is static and hosted on Cloudflare, which may keep standard server
    logs (IP address, user agent, requested URL) for security and abuse
    prevention. That is Cloudflare's processing, governed by their privacy policy,
    and it is not used by this site for analytics or profiling.
  </p>

  <h2>Market data</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Price data is sourced from publicly available market data and processed
    offline before publication. It contains no personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    This site is not directed at children under 13 and knowingly collects no
    information from them.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Material changes to this policy will be reflected in the date at the top of
    this page.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:shastritilak880@gmail.com">shastritilak880@gmail.com</a>
  </p>
</Base>
